    "description": "Manitowoc error codes reference and repair across all five SoCal counties. Indigo NXT touchscreen Easy-Read display with six named alerts: Long Freeze (refrigerant under-charge / condenser fouling / inlet restriction / ambient over spec), No Harvest (harvest assist mechanism / Acu-Thaw hot gas valve / water curtain switch), Curtain Switch (curtain warped or stuck / switch misaligned / wiring fault), Bin Full (legitimate full or sensor fault), High Discharge Temp (compressor overheating / condenser fouling / fan motor failure), Low Water (supply valve / filter / inlet valve). Fault History menu navigation for intermittent-vs-recurring distinction. Service then Reset Faults procedure. Q-Series legacy numeric codes serviced through Welbilt service manuals (model-and-generation specific). AlphaSan antimicrobial + LuminIce II UV maintenance scheduling. EPA 608 Universal plus R-290 hydrocarbon certified. Welbilt parts network (5-7 day standard, 1-3 day expedite). $120 commercial diagnostic, applied toward repair. BHGS #A49573, EPA 608 Universal #1346255700410.",
    "provider": { "@id": canonical + "#business" },
